OL,3,ALatest UK inflation figure about to be
OL,4,Areleased, with rate expected to rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest UK inflation figure will be
OL,7,Freleased at 07:00 GMT
OL,9,FInflation rose to 3.5% in the year to
OL,10,FSeptember - the highest since October
OL,11,F2025, and well above the Bank of
OL,12,FEngland's target of 2%
OL,14,FMost economists expect the rate to rise
OL,15,Fagain, reflecting higher fuel and
OL,16,Fenergy bills
OL,18,FEarlier this month, the Bank raised
OL,19,Finterest rates to 4% - the first
OL,20,Fincrease since 2023 - in an effort to
OL,21,Fcurb inflation
